## Even better: use the same update mechanism

If the standard IDoc function module performs the LIKP update through an update task, you need to understand whether your enhancement executes:

```abap
CALL FUNCTION ... IN UPDATE TASK
```

or during the normal dialog/background processing.

This matters because:

```text
Normal LUW
    |
    +-- application logic
    |
    +-- update task
           |
           +-- database update
```

means that simply doing:

```abap
MODIFY ztable ...
```

from the wrong enhancement location may not give you the transactional behavior you expect.

