| Direct `INSERT/MODIFY` in same LUW                          | **Preferred**, if enhancement executes in the correct LUW |
| `CALL FUNCTION ... IN UPDATE TASK`                          | **Only if required by the standard update architecture**  |
| Separate `COMMIT WORK` after Z-table update                 | **Avoid**                                                 |
| Separate background job after IDoc status 53                | Possible fallback                                         |
| Update Z-table before knowing delivery processing succeeded | **Avoid**                                                 |

